ed cherries and blackberries. In the lightest versions notes of cherries, raspberries and blueberries and with notes of blackberry and black cherries in wines made of more ripe grapes. Many producers employ the use of toasted oak barrels, which provides for increased complexity, aging potential, and hints of vanilla notes. The lightest versions are generally known for flavors and aromas of fresh fruit and dried fruits, and are not recommended for cellaring. Wines with better balance between acid and fruit, often with the addition of oak and having a high alcohol content are more capable of cellaring; these wines often result from reduced-yield viticultural methods.","image_url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/25/Barbera_cluster.JPG/1200px-Barbera_cluster.JPG","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barbera","original_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barbera"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2J6U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ed8aff0-7ffd-49df-91ea-3a306ccbf73c","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"そっちの方もぜひプレイしてみたい","ts":"1631417966.338600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+UY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5F0EE8F1-5BBA-4496-93EE-2FABFB001852","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"同じこと言ってた","ts":"1631417503.338400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w2+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79068FA0-6548-4A4E-AA4E-028D452D9AE1","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"ワイナリーの四季を彷彿とさせますね","ts":"1631417469.338000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7a44"}]},{"client_msg_id":"424d5c9d-c87d-4096-a03c-b8f0080dc487","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"なかなかワ